  <description>
    Research multicopter eVTOL with eight arms carrying coaxial propeller pairs (16 propellers), similar in class to a 2-seat, ~0.6-tonne autonomous aerial vehicle. Parameters are public-figure estimates, not manufacturer data. Each coaxial pair is one PX4 actuator channel and co-rotates in this model so that PX4 retains yaw authority through reaction torque.
  </description>
